---
title: Sketchbook
layout: base.njk
description: "Drawings, digital studies, and visual experiments by Pravan Omprakash."
---

<section class="page-shell gallery-page">
  <header class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Sketchbook</p>
    <h1>Studies in line, color and <em>curiosity.</em></h1>
    <p>Finished pieces, unfinished questions, and visual experiments made along the way.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="masonry-grid sketch-grid">
    {% for art in sketchbook %}
    <figure class="gallery-card sketch-card">
      <button class="gallery-trigger" type="button" data-caption="{{ art.title }} — {{ art.medium }}">
        <img src="{{ art.image | url }}" alt="{{ art.title }}" loading="lazy">
        <span class="art-overlay"><strong>{{ art.title }}</strong><small>{{ art.medium }}</small></span>
      </button>
      <figcaption><strong>{{ art.title }}</strong><span>{{ art.medium }}</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
